# @sploot/common

- `packages/common/src/` owns upload limits, MIME validation (`UPLOAD`,
  `isValidMimeType`), and shared API response types such as
  `SplootApiUploadResponse`.
- Add shared code there, export it from `packages/common/src/index.ts`, and
  import it via `@sploot/common`. Both web and extension consume this package.
- A changed constant or type is a contract change: update both consumers and
  keep `apps/web/docs/API.md` synchronized when routes change.
- The extension resolves the package through its WXT alias; web resolves it
  through the workspace. Preserve both paths.
